  ${themeConfig.displayName} ${isDark ? "Dark" : "Light"} by <a href="https://github.com/Railly/tinte" target="_blank">Tinte</a>
</h3>

<p align="center">
An opinionated multi-platform color theme generator 🎨 <br>
